{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124174","id":4742789242,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGrE4eg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124174","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124174.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124174.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124174","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124174/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124174/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124174/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c74f668045eb3a32caa4ba7e497df5d74a048822","number":124174,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix errors when dragging non-file data onto path properties","user":{"login":"014-code","id":161032298,"node_id":"U_kgDOCZkoag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161032298?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code","html_url":"https://github.com/014-code","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/014-code/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\nWhen dragging a node from the Scene dock onto an @export_file or @export_dir property in the Inspector, the editor repeatedly prints the following error:\r\n\r\n> Bug: Dictionary::operator[] used when there was no value for the given key \"files\". Please report.\r\n\r\nThis happens because EditorPropertyPath::_can_drop_data_fw() accesses drag_data[\"files\"] before checking the drag type.\r\n\r\nThe \"files\" key is only present for drag data originating from the FileSystem dock. Node and resource drags do not contain this key, so hovering them over a path property triggers the error repeatedly.\r\n\r\nThe fix checks the drag type before accessing the file list and uses Dictionary::get() to safely read the type.\r\n\r\nDrop behavior is unchanged. Unsupported node and resource drags are still rejected.\r\n\r\nFixes #124161\r\n\r\n## Steps to reproduce (from issue)\r\n\r\n1.Create a Node2D scene.\r\n2.Attach a script with an @export_file var name: String.\r\n3.Create any child node.\r\n4.Drag the child node onto the exported property in the Inspector.\r\n5.Observe the repeated error messages in the Output panel.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Read the drag type before accessing the \"files\" key.\r\n- Use drag_data.get(\"type\", \"\") to safely read the drag type.\r\n- Only access the file list for supported file drag types.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/god